            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "This guide will walk you through integrating Google Sign-In with Firebase Authentication using the Capacitor Social Login plugin. This setup allows you to use native Google Sign-In on mobile platforms while leveraging Firebase Auth for backend authentication."
